# Keep the build context small and clean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.github
**/.env
**/target                      # Rust/Tauri build output (not needed for the web image)
apps/desktop/src-tauri/onestats-server-dist
services/api/dist              # PyInstaller sidecar output
services/api/media             # local media root
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.claude
